<title>FINLAND: METSALIITTO JAN-AUG PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>METSALIITTO JAN-AUG PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		    298 vs 1,554</p>
<p> Net sales				  12,897 vs 11,437</p>
<p> Profit before tax, minorities	   377 vs 1,541</p>
<p> Operating profit			    669 vs 1,907</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish forest industry cooperative, the</p>
<p>parent of Metsa-Serla is Metsaliitto Yhtyma.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
